            "text": "A centerline SVG stroke is not equivalent to Blink’s non-round border ring, especially for concave contours where it protrudes on the wrong side. Filling the source-derived outer and aligned-inner paths with even-odd winding reduced the focused Chromium comparison from 0.97% to 0.43%.",
