          "message": {
            "text": "Collapsed edges paint after child table-part backgrounds because that is the TablePainter ownership boundary. Emitting the same rectangles in the table box phase was falsified by the focused fixture: cell backgrounds covered the complete edge layer.",
            "markdown": "Collapsed edges paint after child table-part backgrounds because that is the TablePainter ownership boundary. Emitting the same rectangles in the table box phase was falsified by the focused fixture: cell backgrounds covered the complete edge layer."
